break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="47" _msttexthash="2275026" _msthash="1044">Yes—I can see it. I was able to open the video.</p>
<p data-start="49" data-end="71" _msttexthash="385801" _msthash="1045">Here's what I noticed:</p>
<h3 data-section-id="ixkc4c" data-start="73" data-end="85" _msttexthash="93756" _msthash="1046">The good</h3>
<ul data-start="86" data-end="403">
<li data-section-id="chy2si" data-start="86" data-end="146">
<p data-start="88" data-end="146" _msttexthash="2921672" _msthash="1047">✅ It's a real installation, not staged. That builds trust.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="3xxbsu" data-start="147" data-end="233">
<p data-start="149" data-end="233" _msttexthash="5171634" _msthash="1048">✅ The technician is actively replacing an air handler, which demonstrates expertise.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="10nqai8" data-start="234" data-end="345">
<p data-start="236" data-end="345" _msttexthash="7332364" _msthash="1049">✅ The video is vertical (perfect for Google Business Profile, Instagram Reels, Facebook, and YouTube Shorts).</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="a319e4" data-start="346" data-end="403">
<p data-start="348" data-end="403" _msttexthash="2688465" _msthash="1050">✅ The image quality is good enough to use in marketing.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="18zbjzp" data-start="405" data-end="446" _msttexthash="993369" _msthash="1051">What I'd improve for an advertisement</h3>
<p data-start="447" data-end="586" _msttexthash="16801265" _msthash="1052">The raw video is about <strong data-start="470" data-end="484">71 seconds</strong> long. For a Google ad or social media ad, I'd cut it down to <strong data-start="546" data-end="563">20–30 seconds</strong> and add text overlays.</p>
<p data-start="588" data-end="600" _msttexthash="170365" _msthash="1053">For example:</p>
<p data-start="602" data-end="613"><strong data-start="602" data-end="613" _msttexthash="909233" _msthash="1054">0–4 sec</strong></p>
<blockquote data-start="614" data-end="640">
<p data-start="616" data-end="640" _msttexthash="11371269" _msthash="1055">🔥 New HVAC Installation</p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start="642" data-end="654"><strong data-start="642" data-end="654" _msttexthash="919672" _msthash="1056">5–10 sec</strong></p>
<blockquote data-start="655" data-end="682">
<p data-start="657" data-end="682" _msttexthash="535964" _msthash="1057">NATE Certified Technician</p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start="684" data-end="697"><strong data-start="684" data-end="697" _msttexthash="1037647" _msthash="1058">11–18 sec</strong></p>
<blockquote data-start="698" data-end="742">
<p data-start="700" data-end="742" _msttexthash="4592276" _msthash="1059">Professional Installation • Honest Pricing</p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start="744" data-end="757"><strong data-start="744" data-end="757" _msttexthash="1038037" _msthash="1060">19–24 sec</strong></p>
<blockquote data-start="758" data-end="801">
<p data-start="760" data-end="801" _msttexthash="6651008" _msthash="1061">Serving Broward • Miami-Dade • Palm Beach</p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start="803" data-end="816"><strong data-start="803" data-end="816" _msttexthash="1037270" _msthash="1062">25–30 sec</strong></p>
<blockquote data-start="817" data-end="855">
<p data-start="819" data-end="836" _msttexthash="11043682" _msthash="1063">📞 (754) 234-9021</p>
<p data-start="841" data-end="855" _msttexthash="228800" _msthash="1064">Free Estimates</p>
</blockquote>
<h3 data-section-id="190exic" data-start="857" data-end="909" _msttexthash="1464008" _msthash="1065">This is exactly the kind of content Google likes</h3>
<p data-start="910" data-end="996" _msttexthash="3907072" _msthash="1066">People tend to trust <strong data-start="931" data-end="967">real technicians doing real work</strong> much more than stock videos.</p>
<h2 data-section-id="1urh8rc" data-start="998" data-end="1027" _msttexthash="485147" _msthash="1067">I have an even better idea</h2>
<p data-start="1029" data-end="1079" _msttexthash="1441492" _msthash="1068">Remember the <strong data-start="1042" data-end="1058">dog-friendly</strong> video you showed me?</p>
<p data-start="1081" data-end="1137" _msttexthash="1949051" _msthash="1069">I'd create a 30-second commercial using clips like this:</p>
<ol data-start="1139" data-end="1439">
<li data-section-id="1qytm2f" data-start="1139" data-end="1173">
<p data-start="1142" data-end="1173" _msttexthash="1700608" _msthash="1070"><strong data-start="1142" data-end="1151">5 sec</strong> – Technician arrives.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="14r5ipl" data-start="1174" data-end="1214">
<p data-start="1177" data-end="1214" _msttexthash="1888809" _msthash="1071"><strong data-start="1177" data-end="1186">5 sec</strong> – Installing this new unit.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1agyn7c" data-start="1215" data-end="1266">
<p data-start="1218" data-end="1266" _msttexthash="2338193" _msthash="1072"><strong data-start="1218" data-end="1227">5 sec</strong> – Close-up of the clean new equipment.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1pcn2nh" data-start="1267" data-end="1317">
<p data-start="1270" data-end="1317" _msttexthash="2331771" _msthash="1073"><strong data-start="1270" data-end="1279">5 sec</strong> – Happy dogs greeting the technician.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="2z4rbg" data-start="1318" data-end="1373">
<p data-start="1321" data-end="1373" _msttexthash="2733432" _msthash="1074"><strong data-start="1321" data-end="1330">5 sec</strong> – Finished installation running perfectly.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="sebzc9" data-start="1374" data-end="1439">
<p data-start="1377" data-end="1439" _msttexthash="2886611" _msthash="1075"><strong data-start="1377" data-end="1386">5 sec</strong> – Ital Breeze logo + phone number + "Free Estimate."</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="1441" data-end="1469" _msttexthash="611481" _msthash="1076">That tells a complete story:</p>
<ul data-start="1470" data-end="1575">
<li data-section-id="z3lpja" data-start="1470" data-end="1486">
<p data-start="1472" data-end="1486" _msttexthash="196313" _msthash="1077">We show skill.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="9032p7" data-start="1487" data-end="1513">
<p data-start="1489" data-end="1513" _msttexthash="519766" _msthash="1078">We show professionalism.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="actqmj" data-start="1514" data-end="1536">
<p data-start="1516" data-end="1536" _msttexthash="377975" _msthash="1079">We show personality.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1lazlgs" data-start="1537" data-end="1575">
<p data-start="1539" data-end="1575" _msttexthash="821145" _msthash="1080">We end with a strong call to action.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1577" data-end="1653" _msttexthash="3388255" _msthash="1081">I think it would be far more memorable than using only installation footage.</p>
<p data-start="1655" data-end="1806" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="" _msttexthash="12369435" _msthash="1082">And by the way, this video is definitely worth keeping. It's exactly the kind of authentic content that helps distinguish Ital Breeze from competitors.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Response actions" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" _mstaria-label="293956" _msthash="1083" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy response" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed" _mstaria-label="211926" _msthash="1084"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-d674e64d.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Good response" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="good-response-turn-action-button" data-state="closed" _mstaria-label="209443" _msthash="1085"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8">