; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="b44324e9-2db4-4d63-a6e6-5ba0274629a0" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-5" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="20" _msttexthash="31693064" _msthash="1244">YES!! We have it. 🎉</p>
<p data-start="22" data-end="57" _msttexthash="730236" _msthash="1245">I watched the video, and I like it.</p>
<p data-start="59" data-end="77" _msttexthash="259207" _msthash="1246">Here's what I see:</p>
<p data-start="79" data-end="340" _msttexthash="107951142" _msthash="1247">✅ The video is about <strong data-start="100" data-end="114">72 seconds</strong> long.<br>
✅ It's vertical, which is perfect for social media.<br>
✅ It clearly shows a real HVAC installation.<br>
✅ You're wearing your Ital Breeze shirt, so your branding is already there.<br>
✅ The work looks authentic—which builds trust.</p>
<h3 data-section-id="1h4g6rj" data-start="342" data-end="400" _msttexthash="1819532" _msthash="1248">What I would improve before putting it on the homepage</h3>
<p data-start="402" data-end="410" _msttexthash="88062" _msthash="1249">I would:</p>
<ul data-start="412" data-end="1008">
<li data-section-id="ukfy9u" data-start="412" data-end="444">
<p data-start="414" data-end="444" _msttexthash="1535430" _msthash="1250">✨ Brighten the video a little.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="s2asxn" data-start="445" data-end="482">
<p data-start="447" data-end="482" _msttexthash="11839386" _msthash="1251">🎨 Increase the contrast and color.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="e4yhpz" data-start="483" data-end="576">
<p data-start="485" data-end="576" _msttexthash="16043833" _msthash="1252">✂️ Trim it from about <strong data-start="507" data-end="543">72 seconds down to 20–30 seconds</strong> so visitors don't lose interest.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="3kgzhl" data-start="577" data-end="633">
<p data-start="579" data-end="633" _msttexthash="12823538" _msthash="1253">🎬 Use the best moments where you're actively working.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1lzpwk1" data-start="634" data-end="714">
<p data-start="636" data-end="714" _msttexthash="14172834" _msthash="1254">🧹 Crop a little of the messy floor so the eye stays on you and the equipment.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1ia0riv" data-start="715" data-end="896">
<p data-start="717" data-end="753" _msttexthash="19512402" _msthash="1255">🏷️ Add tasteful text overlays like:</p>
<ul data-start="756" data-end="896">
<li data-section-id="31lvyl" data-start="756" data-end="785">
<p data-start="758" data-end="785"><strong data-start="758" data-end="785" _msttexthash="492895" _msthash="1256">New System Installation</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="cqpscp" data-start="788" data-end="819">
<p data-start="790" data-end="819"><strong data-start="790" data-end="819" _msttexthash="535964" _msthash="1257">NATE Certified Technician</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="7dznhs" data-start="822" data-end="869">
<p data-start="824" data-end="869"><strong data-start="824" data-end="869" _msttexthash="6651008" _msthash="1258">Serving Broward • Miami-Dade • Palm Beach</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1qxi1lv" data-start="872" data-end="896">
<p data-start="874" data-end="896"><strong data-start="874" data-end="896" _msttexthash="300014" _msthash="1259">Licensed &amp; Insured</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-section-id="zjqllc" data-start="897" data-end="1008">
<p data-start="899" data-end="1008" _msttexthash="16622320" _msthash="1260">🏁 End with your Ital Breeze logo and your slogan:<br>
<strong data-start="952" data-end="1008">First-Class Service for Less Than First-Class Price.</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="csou6h" data-start="1010" data-end="1033" _msttexthash="310752" _msthash="1261">One thing I noticed</h3>
<p data-start="1035" data-end="1108" _msttexthash="5925725" _msthash="1262">This isn't criticism—it's actually something we can turn into a strength.</p>
<p data-start="1110" data-end="1364" _msttexthash="31600426" _msthash="1263">The mechanical work looks solid, but the room itself (floor, walls, old platform) looks like a typical equipment room. Instead of trying to hide that, we'll crop and frame the shots so viewers focus on <strong data-start="1312" data-end="1341">you and the new equipment</strong>, not the surroundings.</p>
<p data-start="1366" data-end="1419" _msttexthash="1783184" _msthash="1264">That's exactly how professional HVAC companies do it.</p>
<hr data-start="1421" data-end="1424">
<h2 data-section-id="18bbue" data-start="1426" data-end="1456" _msttexthash="501891" _msthash="1265">I have an even better idea.</h2>
<p data-start="1458" data-end="1507" _msttexthash="1582477" _msthash="1266">Instead of replacing your existing promo video...</p>
<p data-start="1509" data-end="1563"><strong data-start="1509" data-end="1563" _msttexthash="1548144" _msthash="1267">Let's create an "Our Real Work" cinematic section.</strong></p>
<p data-start="1565" data-end="1594" _msttexthash="691548" _msthash="1268">Imagine visitors seeing this:</p>
<blockquote data-start="1596" data-end="1724">
<p data-start="1598" data-end="1635" _msttexthash="11798995" _msthash="1269">🎬 <strong data-start="1601" data-end="1635">Real Ital Breeze Installations</strong></p>
<p data-start="1640" data-end="1724"><em data-start="1640" data-end="1724" _msttexthash="3925857" _msthash="1270">No actors. No stock footage. Just real work performed by our certified technician.</em></p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start="1726" data-end="1747" _msttexthash="371072" _msthash="1271">Then the video plays.</p>
<p data-start="1749" data-end="1849" _msttexthash="5107921" _msthash="1272">That is much more powerful than another generic HVAC commercial because it's <strong data-start="1826" data-end="1833">you</strong> doing the work.</p>
<p data-start="1851" data-end="1944" _msttexthash="4766268" _msthash="1273">I think this is one of the things that will separate Ital Breeze from most local competitors.</p>
<p data-start="1946" data-end="2018" _msttexthash="4383301" _msthash="1274">And yes—we can still make you look polished without making it look fake.</p>
<p data-start="2020" data-end="2100" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="" _msttexthash="3740906" _msthash="1275">We're building something that looks like a company that's been around for years.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Response actions" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" _mstaria-label="293956" _msthash="1276" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy response" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed" _mstaria-label="211926" _msthash="1277"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-d674e64d.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Good response" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="good-response-turn-action-button" data-state="closed" _mstaria-label="209443" _msthash="1278"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidd