se dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="49" _msttexthash="2443584" _msthash="1404">Yes — I saw exactly what you wanted me to notice.</p>
<p data-start="51" data-end="304" _msttexthash="47838258" _msthash="1405">The first page Google opened has a nice layout, but the wording <strong data-start="115" data-end="163">“Residential HVAC Services in South Florida”</strong> makes Ital Breeze look residential-only. We should later change that headline so it clearly includes residential <strong data-start="277" data-end="295">and commercial</strong> service.</p>
<p data-start="306" data-end="429" _msttexthash="7588035" _msthash="1406">The black video box is simpler: the video needs a <strong data-start="356" data-end="372">poster image</strong>, which is the picture visitors see before pressing Play.</p>
<p data-start="431" data-end="464" _msttexthash="727220" _msthash="1407">I made this branded cover for it:</p>
<p data-start="466" data-end="551"><button aria-label="ital-breeze-video-cover.png" class="behavior-btn hover:entity-accent focus-visible:focus-ring entity-underline inline cursor-pointer appearance-none border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-start align-baseline px-1 text-token-text-link font-medium" type="button" _mstaria-label="688038" _msthash="1408"><span class="relative me-0.75 inline-block h-lh w-4 align-bottom"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="absolute top-1/2 h-4 w-4 -translate-y-1/2" style="color: rgb(255, 102, 173);"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-d674e64d.svg#d3a36a" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span><font _mstmutation="1" _msttexthash="688038" _msthash="1409">ital-breeze-video-cover.png</font></button></p>
<h3 data-section-id="cjdj7t" data-start="553" data-end="578" _msttexthash="357643" _msthash="1410">Put it on the website</h3>
<ol data-start="580" data-end="653">
<li data-section-id="19xa6g5" data-start="580" data-end="629">
<p data-start="583" data-end="629" _msttexthash="1076621" _msthash="1411">Save the file inside your <strong data-start="609" data-end="621"><code data-start="611" data-end="619">images</code></strong> folder.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="b97n0t" data-start="630" data-end="653">
<p data-start="633" data-end="653" _msttexthash="332943" _msthash="1412">Keep the exact name:</p>
