rflow-hidden rounded-b-[inherit] end-0 bottom-0 w-full"><div data-testid="image-gen-overlay-actions" class="bg-linear-to-b from-transparent to-black/30 h-20 w-full transition-opacity duration-75 ease-out opacity-100"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 flex opacity-100 pointer-events-auto p-3 items-end justify-end"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between"><div class="flex items-end gap-2" data-testid="image-gen-overlay-left-actions"><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="pointer-events-auto z-11 flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-medium text-white h-10 gap-0 rounded-full bg-black/15 px-3 backdrop-blur-md hover:bg-black/30 focus:bg-black/30" aria-label="Edit image" _mstaria-label="130897" _msthash="1699" _msttexthash="44044">Edit</button></div><div class="flex gap-2" data-testid="image-gen-overlay-right-actions"><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="pointer-events-auto z-11 flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-medium text-white group h-10 w-10" aria-label="Share this image" _mstaria-label="256516" _msthash="1700"><span class="flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-black/15 backdrop-blur-md group-hover:bg-black/30 group-focus:bg-black/30"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon fill-current" style="filter: drop-shadow(rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15) 0px 2px 4px);"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-d674e64d.svg#630ca2" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="6939c1ba-c42e-4138-bb0b-5017af59811a" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-5" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="44" _msttexthash="1302873" _msthash="1701">I actually think that's the stronger design.</p>
<p data-start="46" data-end="57" _msttexthash="139243" _msthash="1702">Here's why.</p>
<p data-start="59" data-end="228" _msttexthash="14255748" _msthash="1703">The <strong data-start="63" data-end="91">real video is your proof</strong>. That's what builds trust. When a homeowner sees <em data-start="141" data-end="146">you</em> actually installing equipment, they know they're not watching a stock commercial.</p>
<p data-start="230" data-end="312" _msttexthash="3464149" _msthash="1704">The AI scenes are best used as <strong data-start="261" data-end="283">supporting visuals</strong>, not as the main attraction.</p>
<p data-start="314" data-end="344" _msttexthash="597675" _msthash="1705">So I would build it like this:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="346" data-end="919"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="contents"><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-d674e64d.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│              REAL INSTALLATION • REAL OWNER               │
├───────────────┬────────────────────────────┬───────────────┤
│               │                            │               │
│  Van arriving │   YOUR REAL VIDEO PLAYS    │  You working  │
│               │        (center)            │  on ladder    │
├───────────────┼────────────────────────────┼───────────────┤
│ Dog picture   │ Trust badges / Reviews     │ Commercial AC │
└───────────────┴────────────────────────────┴───────────────┘</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="921" data-end="961" _msttexthash="896779" _msthash="1706">The AI images become <strong data-start="942" data-end="960">framing pieces</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start="963" data-end="1180">
<li data-section-id="eou27b" data-start="963" data-end="994">
<p data-start="965" data-end="994" _msttexthash="11577436" _msthash="1707">🚐 Your branded van arriving.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1009mx8" data-start="995" data-end="1015">
<p data-start="997" data-end="1015" _msttexthash="11165843" _msthash="1708">👷 You in uniform.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1ju3kqj" data-start="1016" data-end="1052">
<p data-start="1018" data-end="1052" _msttexthash="11611756" _msthash="1709">🐶 The dog photo (people love it).</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1sju73s" data-start="1053" data-end="1074">
<p data-start="1055" data-end="1074" _msttexthash="11269388" _msthash="1710">🏢 Commercial HVAC.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1e953yt" data-start="1075" data-end="1100">
<p data-start="1077" data-end="1100" _msttexthash="11447410" _msthash="1711">🏠 Residential service.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="k73lxb" data-start="1101" data-end="1113">
<p data-start="1103" data-end="1113" _msttexthash="1125475" _msthash="1712">⭐ Reviews.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="abksq3" data-start="1114" data-end="1155">
<p data-start="1116" data-end="1155" _msttexthash="19524817" _msthash="1713">🛡️ NATE Certified, Licensed &amp; Insured.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="31owj2" data-start="1156" data-end="1180">
<p data-start="1158" data-end="1180" _msttexthash="11301342" _msthash="1714">📞 Big call-to-action.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1182" data-end="1213" _msttexthash="481897" _msthash="1715">The center stays <strong data-start="1199" data-end="1212">100% real</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="1215" data-end="1237" _msttexthash="446004" _msthash="1716">That combination says:</p>
<blockquote data-start="1239" data-end="1317">
<p data-start="1241" data-end="1317" _msttexthash="3156166" _msthash="1717">"This company looks professional <strong data-start="1274" data-end="1281">and</strong> this owner actually does the work."</p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start="1319" data-end="1412" _msttexthash="4974294" _msthash="1718">That's much more convincing than replacing your real footage with a fully AI-generated video.</p>
<p data-start="1414" data-end="1541" _msttexthash="8715473" _msthash="1719">I also think we can make the whole section feel like a premium commercial by adding subtle animation to the surrounding images:</p>
<ul data-start="1542" data-end="1709">
<li data-section-id="3au1an" data-start="1542" data-end="1575">
<p data-start="1544" data-end="1575" _msttexthash="674102" _msthash="1720">the side panels gently fade in,</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="ohxnwj" data-start="1576" data-end="1608">
<p data-start="1578" data-end="1608" _msttexthash="672724" _msthash="1721">the trust badges animate once,</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1qezczz" data-start="1609" data-end="1643">
<p data-start="1611" data-end="1643" _msttexthash="793273" _msthash="1722">the phone button glows slightly,</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="479m3q" data-start="1644" data-end="1709">
<p data-start="1646" data-end="1709" _msttexthash="2482038" _msthash="1723">while your real installation video keeps playing in the center.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1711" data-end="1740" _msttexthash="427895" _msthash="1724"><strong data-start="1711" data-end="1719">That</strong> is the "WOW" moment.</p>
<p data-start="1742" data-end="1925" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="" _msttexthash="17727190" _msthash="1725">I love this direction, and I think it's the right decision for Ital Breeze. It keeps your authenticity while using polished visuals to elevate the presentation rather than replace it.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Response actions" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" _mstaria-label="293956" _msthash="1726" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy response" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed" _mstaria-label="211926" _msthash="1727"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-d674e64d.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Like this image" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="good-image-turn-action-button" data-state="closed" _mstaria-label="228605" _msthash="1728"><span class="flex items-center just