<p data-start="43" data-end="96" _msttexthash="1477983" _msthash="2190">We are <strong data-start="50" data-end="57">NOT</strong> touching your video anymore. It works.</p>
<p data-start="98" data-end="147" _msttexthash="1442714" _msthash="2191">We are simply going to build the frame around it.</p>
<hr data-start="149" data-end="152">
<h1 data-section-id="g62dph" data-start="154" data-end="162" _msttexthash="41769" _msthash="2192">STEP 1</h1>
