<p data-start="445" data-end="467" _msttexthash="425607" _msthash="2200">Don't change anything.</p>
<hr data-start="469" data-end="472">
<h1 data-section-id="1hto87z" data-start="474" data-end="480" _msttexthash="34008" _msthash="2201">WHY?</h1>
<p data-start="482" data-end="525" _msttexthash="1024972" _msthash="2202">I'm going to replace <strong data-start="503" data-end="524">only that section</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="527" data-end="582" _msttexthash="1951027" _msthash="2203">Everything else on your website stays exactly the same.</p>
<p data-start="584" data-end="593" _msttexthash="108043" _msthash="2204">That way:</p>
<p data-start="595" data-end="621" _msttexthash="1451788" _msthash="2205">✅ your working video stays</p>
<p data-start="623" data-end="642" _msttexthash="1238835" _msthash="2206">✅ your buttons stay</p>
<p data-start="644" data-end="660" _msttexthash="1129778" _msthash="2207">✅ your SEO stays</p>
<p data-start="662" data-end="682" _msttexthash="1266096" _msthash="2208">✅ your services stay</p>
<hr data-start="684" data-end="687">
<p data-start="689" data-end="771" _msttexthash="3739866" _msthash="2209">After you send that screenshot, I'm going to give you one complete block to paste.</p>
<p data-start="773" data-end="784" _msttexthash="147264" _msthash="2210">No hunting.</p>
<p data-start="786" data-end="798" _msttexthash="169871" _msthash="2211">No guessing.</p>
<p data-start="800" data-end="815" _msttexthash="215410" _msthash="2212">No mixing code.</p>
<p data-start="817" data-end="822" _msttexthash="55731" _msthash="2213">Just:</p>
<ol data-start="824" data-end="895">
<li data-section-id="14fuyy2" data-start="824" data-end="849">
<p data-start="827" data-end="849" _msttexthash="436371" _msthash="2214">Highlight old section.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="gv266j" data-start="850" data-end="864">
<p data-start="853" data-end="864" _msttexthash="144378" _msthash="2215">Paste mine.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="13yvnwn" data-start="865" data-end="875">
<p data-start="868" data-end="875" _msttexthash="72410" _msthash="2216">Ctrl+S.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="11v99nk" data-start="876" data-end="886">
<p data-start="879" data-end="886" _msttexthash="85449" _msthash="2217">Commit.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1aoj5da" data-start="887" data-end="895">
<p data-start="890" data-end="895" _msttexthash="53001" _msthash="2218">Push.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="897" data-end="950" _msttexthash="1734187" _msthash="2219">And you'll have the layout we've been dreaming about.</p>
<p data-start="952" data-end="991" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="" _msttexthash="114465689" _msthash="2220"><strong data-start="952" data-end="984">We're building it right now.</strong> 💙❄️❄️</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Response actions" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" _mstaria-label="293956" _msthash="2221" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy response" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed" _mstaria-label="211926" _msthash="2222"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-d674e64d.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Good response" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="good-response-turn-action-button" data-state="closed" _mstaria-label="209443" _msthash="2223"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-h